changes.description:
Factor the existing resolved architectural next PC into a shared signal;
compare it against the instruction's prediction and emit a recovery only
for a valid advancing mismatch. Export legal control-transfer outcome,
PC, target, and type for training; keep PC+4 link writes and traps intact.

